Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:20.13,Song,,0,0,0,,When you open your eyes and see\Nthat pure white light, the story begins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:26.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Stepping forth into a new world,\Nwhat kind of flowers will we make bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:34.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if it's cloudy,\Neven if we get dirty from a puddle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:37.29,Song,,0,0,0,,We continue on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:44.04,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a future we can't imagine\Nwaiting for us, I'm sure of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:47.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Meeting, meeting, and connecting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:51.21,Song,,0,0,0,,If you smile,\Neveryone around you will smile too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's plant a small seed and nurture it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:59.33,Song,,0,0,0,,One day it'll become a large flower
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Turn regrets and failures into fuel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:06.17,Song,,0,0,0,,So that you're overflowing with colorful happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:10.38,Song,,0,0,0,,We'll join hands and share
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:16.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Spread across the world, Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today we're all enjoying\Nanother peaceful morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Great Tree Village\Nhas become quite lively lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My day starts once the sun has\Ncompletely risen each morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:50.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when I wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:02:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you ask me that\Nevery time you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure things are tough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once we found out that\NLu was pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the entire village went into a joyous uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that's why I haven't been\Nable to transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.25,0:02:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was the calmest out of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go check on\Nthe medicinal herb garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay. Are you alright going by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now back to my morning schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to Anne and the maids,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's my job to keep an eye\Non things around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, there's a reason I don't\Nwake up too early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anne and the other maids all insist on\Nwaking up earlier than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sleep later for their sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not being lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I see her in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she lets me know if she has\Nanything to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Last night the wine slime\Nsnuck into the food storage area
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and drank and entire barrel of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that the barrel that we left out\Nto keep the wine slime away from the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm not sure if we should\Ncelebrate our plan working,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or if we should be lamenting the fact\Nthat we let it sneak in at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's just say it went according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I've made my rounds around the house,\Nit's time for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't fit everyone into\Nthe dining hall at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we split breakfast up\Ninto three groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For today's main breakfast menu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we have a soup of daikon radish,\Nspinach, and cabbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We also have smoked killer rabbit\Nthat we've seared to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One microorganism, two microorganisms...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:43.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Flora?\N{\rSubtitle}One microorganism, two microorganisms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One microorganism, two microorganisms...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:46.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Have you not been sleeping?\N{\rSubtitle}One microorganism, two microorganisms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't been making any progress\Non the miso production.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess this is about 20% of the way there...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because you say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I just need more of this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize, and I implore you\Nto get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The second breakfast group is the maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finally, the third group
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is whoever didn't make it in time\Nfor the first or second groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometimes Hakuren doesn't even\Nmake it in time for the third group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor, I'm here to make a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, a group of three killer rabbits\Nattempted to infiltrate the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, Kuro and the dogs\Nwere able to eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.\NThose rabbits never learn their lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we are able to use them as food,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we should be thankful that\Nthey act the way they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, even though\NGranmaria and the other angels
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,always seem so composed and proper,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they all enter lazy mode when they're\Noff duty and on their own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They can't really do any chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anne and the maids prepare their food,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,while they rely on Daga\Nand the other lizardmen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to do their laundry and other cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, they do make up for it with how hard\Nthey work to keep the village safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we have them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I've eaten, it's time to\Nmove onto working the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These things again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,None of the normal garden pests\NI'm familiar with exist in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but instead we have these\Nweird little black things
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that live on the plants and eat their leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Zabuton's kids or Kuro and\Nthe other dogs can spot them for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so as of now, they've yet to cause\Nany real damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the way I deal with them is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,using the almighty farming tool\Nas a watering can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it has the power to\Neliminate garden pests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fields that we've been slowly expanding\Nhave become quite large in size.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Checking on all of them is pretty tough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But seeing all the matured crops\Nfills me with joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and with a sense of satisfaction\Nfor all the work we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While I'm working on my chores,\Nlunch time comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I eat the lunch that Anne and the maids\Nprepared in between my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, having lunch in this world\Nis very out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A meal in the afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we just ate this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I felt the same way when I first came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lunch aside, Lea and the high elves\Nwere nervous about even eating breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if we eat today, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will our food reserves hold out at this rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to them, they weren't always\Nable to eat even a single meal each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean we get to eat food every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're definitely going to get kicked out\Nof this village, aren't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did she reach that conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure that none of them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,have to worry about food\Nas long as they're living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The cows gave birth to calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to increase their allotted feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor, our crop storage room\Nis going to be completely full soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shall we talk to Michael about\Nselling more of what we produce?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's talk to Flow\Nand then decide on how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After lunch time ends, it's back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having more people around\Nhas helped with the farmwork a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But tilling new fields or planting new crops\Nis something I handle myself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,with the almighty farming tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until now, I've only been\Ngrowing stuff we could eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I think adding a little color\Nto our village
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is good for making things\Nfeel more civilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Outside of the farmwork I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the villagers ask me to build\Nall sorts of little things for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can manage to make things\Nfor them even though I have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,no experience in construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once again, I thank God for these blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I also...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,like to occasionally join everyone\Nfor their battle training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to think we'll never need\Nthis training living here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but Anne and the maids strongly advised\Nwe hold regular training
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just in case anything should happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well, getting some more exercise\Nis good for everyone's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we keep eating the way\Nwe do in this village,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,one day we'll no longer be able to fit\Ninto our sacred maid uniforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think mine's already starting to\Nbecome a tighter fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I need some more exercise...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm already at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bet I'd be better with that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm really not suited\Nto use normal weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I still have this spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was amazing! How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly sure when I can use this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once the sun starts to set,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wrap up the work I was doing\Nand head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've never seen this dish before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the new menu item\Nwe're trying out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's simmered killer rabbit\Nserved with a sweet honey sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How confident are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's pretty low...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If possible, I'd like you to only present dishes\Nthat you have at least 50% confidence in...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We cannot afford to waste food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did my best to enjoy the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At dinner time, a lot more people\Ngather around the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We take the chance to report anything\Nthat we want everyone to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess Yuri has sent a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wonder what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see... "I'd like to eat the apples\Nfrom your village again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, I'd like a dress."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She really liked the clothes\Nthat Zabuton made
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and was wondering if she\Ncould have more made for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize. I'll tell her to stop\Nmaking so many requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure Zabuton will be\Nhappy to make something for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I've rested a bit after dinner,\Nit's bath time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I pretty much have the men's\Nbathhouse all to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't really relax when\Nwe only had one bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I forced them\Nto build a men's bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After I get out of the bath,\Nit's time to relax...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or at least I wish it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is usually where\NI start to feel uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's about to enter his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got eyes on him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's headed straight for his bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why is it that I can still feel their eyes\Non me even though I'm inside my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah! Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our cover is blown!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:12.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Everyone, retreat!\N{\rSubtitle}I'm sure they're just keeping watch{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}because they want to keep me safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're just keeping watch\Nbecause they want to keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I tell myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well.\NEven with stuff like that happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be happier with\Nmy everyday life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,God, thank you once again for giving me\Na second chance at life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to have those hidden doors\Nsealed up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:39.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in Another...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.71,0:11:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,World.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whether it's day or night here in the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Donovan and the dwarves are always\Nhard at work making alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When it comes to dwarves,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used to imagine them being merry\Nand getting drunk all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:12:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could possibly produce\Ngood alcohol if we were drunk while working!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even the man in charge of\Nwatching the fire would...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The man in charge of the fire\Ndrinking on the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Out of the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That could cause a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you can see,\Nthey take their job very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think this one came out pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:21.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope. This one's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's lost its flavor and aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is bad booze that does nothing\Nbut burn your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to throw it away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've still got uses for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll distill it some more\Nand then cut it with fruit juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, back to the drawing board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's rethink how we're distilling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have nothing but respect for\Nthe passion with which they make alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you increase the amount\Nof grapes we're harvesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need three times\Nwhat we're harvesting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay... I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Increase the harvest. Three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Three times, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, everyone here really loves their wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's this... strange man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A strange man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a strange man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did he even make it this far\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He made it by Granmaria\Nand Zabuton without them noticing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that the Progenitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.21,0:13:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lulucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um... the Progenitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Progenitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look like you're doing well, Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I first heard that Lulucy was with child,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was sure there must have been\Nsome sort of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm quite surprised myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We vampires usually continue our bloodline\Nby forming new bloodpacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This rarely happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But children are a treasure,\Nand you must take care of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I will. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean he's the Progenitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, I guess you could say\Nhe's like our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm about 4,000 years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,4,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I forget the exact number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't see him as anything other than\Na regular young guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The trick to leading such a long life\Nis to occasionally erase your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I make sure to keep the important stuff\Nlike my name and the clan I belong to,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then I make everything else\Ngo poof and forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It goes poof? Isn't that kind of scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.79,0:14:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was scary the first time,\Nbut I got used to it after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's only been about 200 years since\Nthe last time I erased my memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.58,0:14:50.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I still feel pretty young now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't know vampires had that ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't. I use magic for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magic sounds really useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm really sorry that I\Nentered the village without saying hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd originally planned to just have\Na look around and then quietly leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I was drawn in by a certain presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A presence?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That statue below the big tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a splendid likeness of\Nthe great creator!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, I was bowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you've met God before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. Just once, when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He told me to do my best
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even though I would be born with\Na slightly abnormal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And by abnormal body he meant vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I feel like\NI've faced a lot of hardships
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and been saved a number of times...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I can't be sure since\NI've erased my memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I get the feeling\Nthat I've done my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I do remember the creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just that for some reason,\NI can't remember his exact appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was he an old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:16:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What color were his eyes?\NWhat color was his hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've tried numerous times\Nto create a likeness of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I've never created anything\Nas accurate as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure living nearby\Na masterpiece like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,means that every single day\Nof your life is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It must be so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He wants it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, about that statue...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the village,\Nso I don't think I can offer it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew it. I get it. But it's too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's too bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:36.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd like,\N{\rSubtitle-2}Too bad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could make you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not a sculptor, so I'm not sure\Nif you'll like what I make or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think he likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:17:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the sudden request.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How much should I pay you for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I can't take money for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,God isn't something\Nthat you're supposed to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have to think about\Nsomething else I can do as thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure you give birth to a healthy baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good health to you too, Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you as well, Progenitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for this statue,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and for what you've done for Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep taking care of her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was a little surprised at first,\Nbut he seems like an easygoing guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And to think, he's such an incredibly\Nimportant and high-ranking person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is he really that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.\NHow many years does this make?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:58.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe it's been 50 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:18:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I've become an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you're in charge of the temple now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, for about 30 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well you've always been a devout believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Has anything changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not a thing. Everything is as it always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there's going to be\Na big change starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What might you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to enshrine this statue\Nhere in this temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do? What kind of statue is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to put it in the best spot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'd have to move\Nthe statue of the creator
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that was crafted by the\Nmaster sculptor, Toorook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if we can simply move\Nthe most beloved statue in this temple
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,from its resting place...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sure we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is such... a majestic work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It must have been made by\Nquite a famous sculptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We must be sure that everyone\Nproperly honors their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it would be better if we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:12.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like the type\Nto appreciate stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't want to do anything\Nto disturb his peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That is most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I don't think it would be a problem\Nif we were to quietly support him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.33,0:19:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let all the other temples know immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell them to be respectful of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,as well as respectful of\NThe Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That caught me off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I've sneezed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Progenitor sent us a magnificent piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I refused to take payment for the statue,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so he said this was a gift\Nto celebrate Lu's pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's really considerate\Nfor someone so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We talked for a while\Nabout where we would put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We decided to place it\Nin the village's dining hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks guys. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That piano...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it the kind that you would\Nonly find in a large temple?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's the kind of piano\Nthat only gets used for big ceremonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.\NDo you think it's okay if we play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is a once in a lifetime-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No... it's more like a\Nnever in a lifetime chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means if we can play this piano now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll be able to brag about this\Nfor the rest of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with playing later, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This thing is way too scary\Nfor us to even try playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My hands are sweating so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:51.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we break it,\Nthat'll be the end of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want another piano?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,F-for us to practice on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please. We don't mind\Nif it's old and beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, an old piano would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't you play the one we already have?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We talked to Michael and had him\Nprocure a practice piano for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't really know anything about these,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the one we got from\Nthe Progenitor seems a lot fancier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I feel bad that he sent us\Nsomething so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The pianos were hit.\NEveryone wanted to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only ones who could already play well
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,were Flowrem and the girls from\Nthe Demonic Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but everyone else seems to enjoy\Npracticing to get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just wish they'd stop playing at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:38.96,Song,,0,0,0,,I can feel the soft seasonal winds,\Ngently on my fingertips
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:47.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's search for what we love\Nin the clouds floating in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:52.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Forget about the hands of the clock for now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:57.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Try taking one deep breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:06.71,Song,,0,0,0,,The rainbow-colored scenery\Nwill resonate with my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:13.04,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm sure any wish I have will come true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:17.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Because you're by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:22.17,Song,,0,0,0,,You make every day feel like a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:26.96,Song,,0,0,0,,At that warm and kind place
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:34.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Keep showing me your smiling face forever
